note bottom of OBS
  Only visible board cells and the player's own
  resources cross the observation boundary,
  because private state would taint the proof.
  Hidden cells keep their positions while
  concealing enemy contents.
end note

note bottom of ADMISSION
  Stage both seats against the same open state,
  because sequential mutation would change
  simultaneous admission semantics. Keep bank
  state separate from the native snapshot and
  apply income only at native grant boundaries.
end note

note bottom of BRIDGE
  Each one-shot request reconstructs the same
  fixture rather than accepting caller state.
  This confines the bridge to compatibility
  checks and cannot establish a persistent
  match runner or a general replay protocol.
end note

note bottom of POLICY
  The policy receives only the limited
  observation before selecting an action, since
  full engine state would cross the boundary.
  Native settlement details become report data
  after selection and never feed the scorer.
end note

note bottom of SESSION
  Both seats select from the same native
  opening before private admission exposes
  truth. Stage requests independently, then
  merge in white-black order so one seat
  cannot alter the other's admission context.
end note

note right of SESSION
  Retain the mineral bank outside native
  transitions, because snapshots may omit
  stored resources. Grant income once at
  settlement; a terminal begin must never
  apply another income grant.
end note

note bottom of REPLAY_NATIVE
  Replay checks native results and policy
  choices without reusing the live commit path.
  Its private token feeds baseline evaluation,
  where ledger proof cannot certify which
  policy chose an action or change win counts.
end note

note bottom of EVAL
  Native rejection remains a failed case even
  when independent replay confirms its cause.
  Keep every scheduled case in the denominator
  so verified terminals cannot hide failures
  or convert window limits into draws.
end note

note bottom of ECO_PROJECT
  Filter private effects before assigning
  recipient sequences, because global IDs and
  frame gaps disclose hidden events. A witness
  requires native causal proof, not a planned
  target or an assumed killer ownership.
end note

note bottom of ECO_HOST
  Rebuild native consequences without calling
  the existing replay or choosing a policy.
  Only a complete conserved ledger and clean
  worker exit permit the host to construct
  its private ledger token.
end note

note bottom of CLOSEOUT
  Keep terminal closeout separate from native
  receipts, because final grants remain replay
  truth. Exclude only the actual credit bound
  to the final unused settlement, never income
  inferred from a game-over counter.
end note

note right of CLOSEOUT
  Zero usable gas means no remaining intent,
  not a refund of native expenditure. This
  host-only view changes neither terminal
  rewards nor feature history, and does not
  claim a measured reduction in training bias.
end note

legend bottom
  Baseline proof stays historical in native-runner.md; ledger proof lives in native-economic-ledger.md.
  v1 smoke: two reconstructed one-shot calls / 30 s total includes 3 s reap.
  v1 Burn Flex f64 / 418 zero-padded rows / e1 -> d1 or f1 / black pass.
  v1 smoke mine observation cap 2 remains unchanged; v2 counts up to 3 entities.
  v2 request 64 KiB / reply 1 MiB / cumulative stderr 64 KiB; clear NODE_OPTIONS.
  v2 300 s total includes 3 s cleanup; decision 10 s absolute; xtask 600=597+3 s.
  Linux/Unix trusted built-in worker; no hostile-code sandbox or timing-fit claim.
  arena-policy-seeds-v1: base + (ordinal+1)*0x9e3779b9 + black*0x85ebca6b mod 2^32.
  Fixed fixtures do not use environmentSeed; case/fixture/seed metadata is host-only.
  Initial image is host-only; per-window truth follows both selections or stopped planning.
  Native outcome only; nonterminal host window limit is NOT a draw.
  scheduled = verified-terminal + verified-window-limited + failed/unverified.
  CLI config <=64 KiB / record <=16 MiB; private fresh outputs / no overwrite.
  fullRunner=true states capability, not verification, training or a learned scorer.
  Economic command is ONE native-consequence pass; policyVerification=not-executed.
  Existing arena replay alone owns baseline native+policy verification and W/D/L admission.
  Both recipients share one 1048576-work / 10 s window transaction; helpers do not reset it.
  One absolute 300 s economic lifecycle includes 3 s cleanup; no chunks or truncated events.
  Native turns 1/11/21 grant nominal 1/2/3 after settlement; exact actual credits can be capped.
  Economic-v1 birth.mode / transform.toMode: required tank|siege for rook, null otherwise.
  Native same-entity origin trace only; afterOwn is reconciliation, not mode authority.
  Complete verified native terminal only; exclude the exact final unused actual-credit receipt.
  usableGas={w:0,b:0} means no terminal intent budget, never a native expense refund.
  Private chronology and terminal proof charges reuse the existing window meter.
  No closeout enters AuthorizedFeatureHistory, WDL rewards, frozen D+B truth or calibration.
  Terminal safeguards establish no measured bias reduction, learner permission or training proof.
  F1 helper has NO CLI/live-policy/native-permission/RPC edge; queue ownership is local identity only.
  Geometry prepaid units: empty128; append512+192n; schedule2048+256n^2; shape512; ray512; vision8192.
  Vision returns canonical litSquares ONLY, never revealedPieces; native exceptions have no rescue.
  Legacy manifest dependency is TEST ONLY; the structural startup context is not native authority.
  Exact418 metadata agreement does not compute encoder values/masks/formulas or alter frozen labels.
  Verifier notEstablished: full-training-closure / genuine-native-authority / whole-decision-adequacy.
  Verifier notEstablished also includes calibration / training-readiness; no new helper-local meter.
  No R4 economy/belief/features/calibration/readiness closure or pinned-54 win claim.
  Preserve legacy consumers/evidence; delete legacy LAST after final consumer parity.
endlegend
